@prefix cdsg: <https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#> .
@prefix ex: <https://w3id.org/cdsg/test/> .
ex:twoStatementCategory a cdsg:PolicyTargetCategory .
ex:defStatement a cdsg:ExplicitTargetCategoryDefinition ; cdsg:definesTargetCategory ex:twoStatementCategory .
ex:opStatement a cdsg:TargetCategoryOperationalization ; cdsg:operationalizesTargetCategory ex:twoStatementCategory .
